Usage: cortex backend [options] [command]

Additive backend runtime setup and verified development provisioning

Options:
  -d, --deployment <name>          Deployment alias from configuration
  -f, --format <format>            Output format: table, json, csv
  --quiet                          Suppress diagnostic hints
  --debug                          Diagnostic details on stderr
  --scope-user <id>                Explicit caller scope user (not a
                                   target/filter)
  --tenant <id>                    Exact tenant scope (ordinary operations
                                   require --scope-user)
  --token-env <name>               Host JWT environment variable name (default
                                   CORTEX_AUTH_TOKEN)
  --token-file <path>              Current-owner private regular JWT file,
                                   reread per operation
  --tenant-id <id>                 Verified runtime tenant selector
  --memory-space-id <id>           Verified runtime space selector
  --graph-sync <mode>              Graph policy: auto, off, required
  -h, --help                       display help for command

Commands:
  install [options] [directory]    Install versioned backend sources; ambiguous
                                   host merges are refused
  register [options] [directory]   Register installed functions on a verified
                                   disposable development target
  provision [options] [directory]  Provision a trusted current grant on a
                                   verified disposable development target
  configure [options] [directory]  Append public runtime metadata, preserving
                                   existing environment values
  guide [options]                  Show current setup prerequisites and explicit
                                   capability limits
  help [command]                   display help for command
